OL,3,GNEWSAConcern potential housing site is
OL,4,Ahome to rare bat
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns a rare bat could be present at
OL,7,Fa potential housing site, have been
OL,8,Fraised by campaigners opposed to
OL,9,Fdevelopment.
OL,11,FEast Devon District Council is working
OL,12,Fto finalise its draft local plan which
OL,13,Fidentifies sites where building
OL,14,Fprojects could be suitable, according
OL,15,Fto the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,16,FService (LDRS).
