OL,3,GNEWSAConcern potential housing site is
OL,4,Ahome to rare bat
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatthew Hart said he lived "a stone's
OL,7,Fthrow" away from the site of proposed
OL,8,Fhousing development Exmo_20 and having
OL,9,Ffound a dead Barbastelle bat in his
OL,10,Fgarden its presence warranted
OL,11,Fconsideration over whether to include
OL,12,Fthe land in the plan.
OL,14,FThe council said none of its
OL,15,Fassessments had indicated Barbastelle
OL,16,Fbats were within or near the site.
